  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bonded Casting</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you rest to regain spell points, choose one teamwork feat you possess. Your bonded creature gains that teamwork feat as a bonus feat until you choose a different teamwork feat with this feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat multiple times, each time allowing you to select an additional teamwork feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc106\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
